          "text": "Nasi khulwanje, yino niyo indakano yanje ninabo; niko aka OMWAMI aboola; roho wanje ouli mwiwe, khandi amakhuwa kanje aka ndara mumunwakwo, shibilarula mumunwakwo ta, kata mumunwa kwabaanabo, kata muminwa chiabaanabo, kata mumumwa kwabeetsukhulubo, okhurula olwa leelo okhuula khubisoni nebisoni; niko aka OMWAMI aboola.",
